--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogs_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5bc8b2e89169b9342bbd3c7d58a6cbb9, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 4000066107858944
    m_Localized: Hello, youngster, how are you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000222798667776
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000353807753216
    m_Localized: Astra, we played war and I had the biggest stick!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000762681090048
    m_Localized: And you defeated them all?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000892612239360
    m_Localized: 'Yes! Everyone was afraid of me, and...

      Oh! Tell me, what
      was the biggest boom stick ever made?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4001254710697984
    m_Localized: Ummm, sure, I'll see what I can find out now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4002995111976960
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4002015326756864
    m_Localized: That's how they came up with the machine gun, and then...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4003082785513472
    m_Localized: And then women got the right to stop the most terrible conversations
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4003440253460480
    m_Localized: Good day)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4003623716511744
    m_Localized: In fact, you were never given these rights)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4003819229798400
    m_Localized: Astra, I made an order on VB and something strange is happening
      there, can you help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4004134989586432
    m_Localized: One foot here, one foot there
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4004416020537344
    m_Localized: Therefore, I recommend ordering from Ozon...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4004653061627904
    m_Localized: Useless bag of meat...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4005319557505024
    m_Localized: Everything is fine with the order, you can continue to eat your
      carbohydrate life destroyers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4005703323738112
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4005789936115712
    m_Localized: Thank you Astra, actually Sarah has some problems... Can you talk
      to her?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4005940557766656
    m_Localized: Well, who asked you to give birth? Useless...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4006098376843264
    m_Localized: I'll try to think of something
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4006223182553088
    m_Localized: Sarah, how are you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4006329831120896
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4006395119656960
    m_Localized: You won't understand me...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4006505220136960
    m_Localized: I may not understand, but if you try to talk about your problems
      out loud, you will probably feel better
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4006728889786368
    m_Localized: Maybe... in fact, I'm just showing off and wanting attention and
      I'm going through a difficult age. And I want you to tell me some interesting
      psychological fact!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4007190254837760
    m_Localized: "\u041E_\u041E"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4007571714203648
    m_Localized: Oh... In short, he doesn't love me, but he says that he loves her,
      but I know that he doesn't love her and...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4007807547334656
    m_Localized: Aaa, a fly is also a helicopter!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4007899738136576
    m_Localized: Ahh, I get it, I'll watch something now
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4008502769999872
    m_Localized: You are a nobody
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4008722228568064
    m_Localized: Not really.. I have some information.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4009041494794240
    m_Localized: "All people are fools, you are a fool too, I don\u2019t want to
      waste time on you, so have fun..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4009444022149120
    m_Localized: Fuck you! I'll beat you and all your Pokemon!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4009813414502400
    m_Localized: I see you've dealt with this trash... But can you deal with yourself?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015311790530560
    m_Localized: A?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015978835861504
    m_Localized: Sounds not bad...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015801785901056
    m_Localized: Welcome to the largest online marketplace in the network!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4016240338132992
    m_Localized: You can't even imagine how cool it is here and what we don't have!
      We even have our own crypto wallet!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4016516700823552
    m_Localized: Wow, wallet. And now they remove it for backup?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4016762755473408
    m_Localized: What backup?!..
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4016952564506624
    m_Localized: Why are you so nervous? I just asked...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4017937626161152
    m_Localized: You made a huge contribution, I don't even know what we would do
      without you...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4018092328869888
    m_Localized: No need, you can just give me money)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4019066506305536
    m_Localized: Ah, indeed. Here is your reward...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4019187222568960
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4031751708991488
    m_Localized: Astra, tell me, what will the weather be like?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4031912472469504
    m_Localized: Of course, one point...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4032046316904448
    m_Localized: Umm, it seems my server is having some problems updating.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4032500287397888
    m_Localized: I go into standby mode until the update is complete
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 127223717339136
    m_Localized: I can't clear the rubble, help me sort it out and find the crypto-cyber-archive
      and with its help I can help you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 127259637358592
    m_Localized: It turns out he's a slacker... but what can he do?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4311222991888384
    m_Localized: An unexpected result with such restraint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4311737540714496
    m_Localized: Containment?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4311818041991168
    m_Localized: You didn't use any incarnations
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4312085399511040
    m_Localized: You mean those guns...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4312221106216960
    m_Localized: I thought this was your program...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4312418657935360
    m_Localized: In general, you can use visualization to manifest any entities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4313718359498752
    m_Localized: Ooooh. Got it, accepted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4662799187484672
    m_Localized: Oh, no! How did you manage to beat me? You have found harmony, now
      you can come back...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4663311597215744
    m_Localized: I'm a beauty!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4663435199160320
    m_Localized: Isn't this what they call schizophrenia?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 127517050183680
    m_Localized: Why has it become so empty here...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 127550239711232
    m_Localized: Who are you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 127589305458688
    m_Localized: Better ask, "Who am I?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 127618720112640
    m_Localized: Uh-uh, who are you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 127653386035200
    m_Localized: "No, \u201CWho am I,\u201D like you\u2019re \u201Cwho am I,\u201D
      not \u201Cwho are you?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 127668267425792
    m_Localized: Ah, I get it! Hello, I'm Astra
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5015377767211008
    m_Localized: And why does your pumping disappear?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5015717354840064
    m_Localized: I have no idea
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
